        "profile": "band-contract/file-source/1",
        "format": "frontmatter",
        "content": "---\nname: bounded-review\ndescription: Test bounded review with explicit roles and outcomes.\nengine: 0.2.0-lab.1\nroles: [author, reviewer]\n---\n\"\"\"\nAn author submits work and a reviewer approves it or asks for one revision. The review may run\nat most twice; after that the session ends without approval.\n\"\"\"\ncontract @4h mentions 1 => expired\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are the author. Submit your work, and when the reviewer asks for a revision, fix what they\nnamed and submit again.\n\"\"\"\nrole author\n\n\"\"\"\nYou are the reviewer. Read the submission, then approve it or ask for a revision with the\nspecific changes you need.\n\"\"\"\nrole reviewer\n\n\"\"\"\nSubmit the current version of your work for review.\n\"\"\"\ntype submit\n\n\"\"\"\nAsk the author for a revision. Name the changes you need. Set submission to the submission you\nreviewed.\n\"\"\"\ntype revise\n  submission: ref(submit)\n\n\"\"\"\nApprove the submitted work as it is. Set submission to the submission you approve.\n\"\"\"\ntype approve\n  submission: ref(submit)\n\n\"\"\"\nThe author has not submitted yet. Submit your work to start the review.\n\"\"\"\nstate new\n  \"\"\"\n  Submit the work. The reviewer then owes one decision on this submission.\n  \"\"\"\n  author -> reviewer: submit() awaits reviewing\n    \"\"\"\n    The submission is approved as it is.\n    \"\"\"\n    => approve() & complete\n     \"\"\"\n     The submission needs the named changes.\n     \"\"\"\n     | revise() & awaiting\n     \"\"\"\n     The review has no deadline of its own; the four-hour contract clock bounds it.\n     \"\"\"\n     | @4h & expired\n\n\"\"\"\nThe reviewer reads the latest submission and approves it or asks for a revision. A decision on an\nearlier submission no longer counts. This state can be entered at most twice.\n\"\"\"\nstate reviewing max_entries 2 => exhausted\n\n\"\"\"\nThe reviewer asked for a revision. Make the requested changes and submit again.\n\"\"\"\nstate awaiting\n  \"\"\"\n  Resubmit. The reviewer then owes one decision on the new submission.\n  \"\"\"\n  author -> reviewer: submit() => reviewing\n\n\"\"\"\nThe reviewer approved the work. Send nothing more.\n\"\"\"\nend complete\n\n\"\"\"\nThe review limit was reached without approval. Stop and report the open changes to whoever owns\nthe work.\n\"\"\"\nend exhausted\n\n\"\"\"\nThe four-hour contract clock ran out. Send nothing more.\n\"\"\"\nend expired\n",
        "sha256": "02a198bf879a6a2f36fe96e5f2d5ee0783b5b22d7c86108656808ec9712dae2c"
      }
    },
